  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoon butter",
    "4 large egg",
    "3 ounce grated parmesan cheese",
    "1/2 cup sour cream",
    "cayenne pepper (to taste)",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "24 ounce asparagus spears",
    "3 tablespoon butter",
    "1 1/2 tablespoon lemon juice"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/brown-butter-asparagus-with-creamy-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53637-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Brown-Butter-Asparagus-with-Creamed-Eggs-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Over medium heat, add butter to a frying pan and stir the eggs in until scrambled. Be sure not to overcook the eggs.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/brown-butter-asparagus-with-creamy-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53637-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Brown-Butter-Asparagus-with-Creamed-Eggs-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the eggs to a blender along with parmesan cheese and sour cream. Blend until smooth/creamy, then season with cayenne and salt to taste.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/brown-butter-asparagus-with-creamy-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53637-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Brown-Butter-Asparagus-with-Creamed-Eggs-3.png"
    },
    {
      "text": "Over medium heat, add olive oil to a frying pan and cook asparagus. Once fork-tender, remove from frying pan and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/brown-butter-asparagus-with-creamy-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53637-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Brown-Butter-Asparagus-with-Creamed-Eggs-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "On medium-low heat, add butter to the same pan. Cook until butter is golden brown in color and has a nutty aroma. Remove from heat and let cool for 1-2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/brown-butter-asparagus-with-creamy-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53637-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Brown-Butter-Asparagus-with-Creamed-Eggs-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once butter is slightly cooled, add lemon juice and stir together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/brown-butter-asparagus-with-creamy-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53637-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Brown-Butter-Asparagus-with-Creamed-Eggs-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Over medium-low heat, add the brown butter with lemon juice and asparagus back to the pan. Remove when hot.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/brown-butter-asparagus-with-creamy-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53637-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Brown-Butter-Asparagus-with-Creamed-Eggs-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Plate the asparagus alongside the creamed eggs and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/brown-butter-asparagus-with-creamy-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53637-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
